            <a class="module-card directory-card" href="/previews/curriculum/basics/stairs/index.html"><div class="directory-card-top"><span class="module-index directory-card-number" aria-hidden="true">05</span><span class="directory-card-kicker">连接不同标高</span></div><strong class="module-title directory-card-title">楼梯</strong><span class="module-desc directory-card-description">从踏步、梯段和平台读懂竖向交通，结合净空、防护与结构连接检查楼梯及入口高差。</span><div class="directory-card-tags"><span>梯段平台</span><span>净空防护</span><span>台阶坡道</span></div><span class="directory-card-footer"><span>浏览章节</span><span class="directory-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
